Subject: [PATCH 2/7] feat: add per-task model routing to routine worker tool

- Routine worker now resolves provider/model per task_type from
  config.yaml / built-in defaults.
- Configured routes: minimax-m3 (default/marketplace/web), qwen3.7-plus
  (strong web), deepseek-v4-flash (cheap), gpt-5.4-mini (kb triage).
- delegate_task accepts optional provider/model/base_url/api_key/api_mode
  overrides so the runtime can route child agents independently of the
  global delegation config.
